. No interior house-cleaning tag; weekend hours, guarantees, experience and safety claims not adopted. No street address established."}'::jsonb,'Individually sourced relaunch addition; primary-site desk check only','https://www.espinosapowerwashing.com/'); insert into public.listing_checks(business_id,source_url,checked_fields,service_areas,service_tags,scope_note) values(bid,'https://www.espinosapowerwashing.com/',array['identity','public phone','website','advertised services','advertised service area'],array['Mountain House','Tracy','Lathrop','Manteca'],array['pressure washing','exterior cleaning','driveway cleaning','soft washing'],'First-party website desk check only. No owner confirmation, credential validation, availability check or quality endorsement. Primary website confirms phone, Tracy base, exterior services and named service areas. No interior house-cleaning tag; weekend hours, guarantees, experience and safety claims not adopted. No street address established.'); end $curate$;
